             exactly one enabled. The app switches them with setComponentEnabledSetting; a new
             install shows Hop on light, the only one enabled here. Each carries the launcher
             shortcuts (On / Off, Peers, DNS, Diagnostics): the system reads them from the
             enabled launcher activity, so all must name them, under the same ids. -->
